{"chars": "The path led into a forest of the tallest, straightest trees Mrs. Claus had ever seen: Japanese cedars, with reddish bark that peeled in long strips, and trunks so wide that it would take three people holding hands to reach around them. Their tops disappeared into the mist far above. The air smelled sweet and spicy, of cedar wood and wet earth and rain. Ferns grew everywhere, and thick green moss covered every rock and every root, sparkling with raindrops. Somewhere in the trees, a frog was singing, kero, kero, kero.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.325, 0.325, 0.325, 0.325, 0.325, 0.7, 0.7, 0.7, 0.7, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 1.113, 1.113, 1.212, 1.212, 1.212, 1.212, 1.212, 1.212, 1.212, 1.637, 1.637, 1.637, 1.712, 1.712, 1.712, 1.712, 1.837, 1.837, 1.837, 1.837, 1.837, 1.837, 1.837, 1.837, 2.375, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 3.3, 3.3, 3.3, 3.3, 3.3, 3.625, 3.625, 3.625, 3.625, 3.625, 3.625, 3.938, 3.938, 3.938, 3.938, 4.062, 4.062, 4.062, 4.062, 4.062, 4.312, 4.312, 4.312, 4.312, 4.312, 5.0, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.612, 5.612, 5.612, 5.612, 5.612, 5.612, 5.612, 6.3, 6.375, 6.375, 6.375, 6.375, 6.375, 6.55, 6.55, 6.55, 6.55, 6.55, 6.55, 6.55, 6.55, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 7.25, 7.25, 7.25, 7.25, 7.25, 7.375, 7.375, 7.375, 7.375, 7.375, 7.375, 7.375, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 7.85, 7.85, 7.85, 7.85, 7.85, 8.125, 8.125, 8.125, 8.125, 8.125, 8.125, 8.125, 8.8, 8.9, 8.9, 8.9, 8.9, 9.025, 9.025, 9.025, 9.025, 9.025, 9.025, 9.025, 9.387, 9.387, 9.387, 9.65, 9.65, 9.65, 9.65, 9.65, 10.05, 10.05, 10.05, 10.05, 10.05, 10.162, 10.162, 10.162, 10.238, 10.238, 10.238, 10.238, 10.238, 10.238, 10.35, 10.35, 10.35, 10.35, 10.35, 10.588, 10.588, 10.588, 10.588, 10.588, 10.588, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 11.2, 11.2, 11.2, 11.2, 11.2, 11.2, 11.2, 11.2, 11.575, 11.575, 11.575, 11.575, 11.575, 11.575, 11.925, 11.925, 11.925, 